  "id": "myeloarchitecture",
  "term": "myeloarchitecture",
  "definition": "Myeloarchitecture is the organized pattern and arrangement of myelinated nerve fibers within brain tissue, such as the layers of the cerebral cortex. In cortical dysplasia, this myelin-based structure can be reduced or disorganized.",
